    "text": "unfilteredwithkiran.com\nwebsite\nDenham Springs\nAntique Village businesses vandalized hours after liquor license vote\nBy Allyson Bird,\n3 hours agoDENHAM SPRINGS — Two businesses in Antique Village were vandalized, defaced with graffiti on August 12. Fab Four Barbershop and the Mustard Seed Creamery both had vulgar pictures, words, and messages spray painted on their buildings and windows. The vandalism happened after the Denham Springs City Council meeting, where...\n1",
